WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.580
Hey guys. This is going to be a bit more of a serious vlog than I've done in the past, because as many of you know

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:12.000
and as many of you probably don't know, over this past weekend there was a series of tragedies and I won't go

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:21.540
into too many details, but they involved shootings and a lot of death and these are subjects that I don't normally

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:29.260
talk about on my channel and unfortunately they happen too often, and when they do, you guys often ask me

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:36.820
Y'know, to speak out about it, or try to tell you guys a way that we can prevent it or stop it from happening.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:44.260
And I- I'm very hesitant to do those things because one, I'm not in any way qualified.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:50.840
I do this channel because it's for entertainment and it's for you guys and those of you out there who enjoy

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:56.700
watching my videos, I know that I make videos to make you laugh and I know I make videos to give you guys

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:03.140
an escape from your daily lives. And when something like this, something so big that it affects so many people

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:12.900
and it kind of crosses barriers where it shouldn't cross barriers. I just want to say a few things and not even

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:19.220
specifically about the subject at hand. I want to say things to you guys on an individual level.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:27.260
And I know that's hard because I am literally sitting in my bathroom talking to a camera that's going out to over a

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:34.040
million people, and it's really hard to make that connection on an individual level, but that's what

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:39.240
I want to do when I make these videos. That's what I really want to do when I make all of my videos.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.280
And so the one thing that was standing out in my mind that I had to tell you guys is ;

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:59.340
I want you guys to be as good as you can be. And to be as connected as you can be to those around you,

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:06.140
because we as people, we can get together and we can make, y'know protests, we can march in the streets,

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:12.220
we can do whatever, we can make change, but when it comes down to the loneliness that you feel when

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:23.040
you're by yourself and you are feeling so isolated from the world and you see these things that happen and

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:30.960
You- you know that you feel you can't do anything about it and it's that feeling of helplessness that really

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:43.160
gets people down. And so I just want to tell you, as an individual, that the best thing that you could possibly do

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:55.260
is be as good as you possibly can, and be the best person that you can, and try to share that good

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.240
with those around you.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:03.240
Because I'm not qualified to talk about how to solve these problems. I don't know the first thing about,

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.440
like, preventing these things from happening.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:14.200
But this channel has always been about encouraging you as an individual, as a creator, as a person, as a friend,

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.700
as a member of your community, like, whatever you are;

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.260
Try to be the best that you possibly can be.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:27.020
So that's all I wanted to say about it. I don't want to come across like I'm trying to make someone else's

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:33.640
tragedy about myself. Because that is the exact opposite of what I want, and that's never what I

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:43.460
would want to do. All I'm trying to say is that you, as an individual, you're never alone.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:50.100
And you're never going to be alone, and whether that's good or bad, like literally, you're never going to be alone,

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:57.740
because what you do, and who you are, is always going to affect someone else in this world, like we're literally

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:04.820
all connected, and that's obviously a big "Kumbaya" statement that's all very happy-go-lucky statement,

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:13.500
but it's absolutely true, and it's more evident than ever in these situations. So just remember that the good that

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:20.500
you do, and the good that you bring to the world... It really does make a difference.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:29.240
So thank you everybody so much for watching, and as always, I will see you in the next video.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:31.220
Buh-bye.

